# Surge of Salvation: "black and/or red sources" is any source that is black or red, whatever else it is (CR 105.2), and no
# colorless source. Bot2 attacks with Witherbloom Apprentice (black-green) and Afterthought Sentry (colorless), each blocked by a
# 0/2 Ornithopter; Bot1 casts Surge. The Ornithopter blocking the black-green source lives; the one blocking the colorless
# Sentry dies. "Permanents you control" are Bot1's only: afterwards Bot1's Lightning Bolt targets Bot2's Sentry and kills it.
# Bot1's Mox Ruby, Lightning Bolt and Plains pay for them.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Mox Ruby
Surge of Salvation
Lightning Bolt
Plains
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mountain
Witherbloom Apprentice
Afterthought Sentry
Mountain
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Witherbloom Apprentice.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Afterthought Sentry.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Witherbloom Apprentice > Bot1; Afterthought Sentry > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Ornithopter > Witherbloom Apprentice; Ornithopter#2 > Afterthought Sentry)
[T4 Bot2.DeclareBlockers]
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Surge of Salvation.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.CombatDamage]
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Afterthought Sentry)
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Mox Ruby; Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Emerald; Mox Ruby; Mountain; Witherbloom Apprentice
